# Everything that ships to an Unraid server must have LF line endings: the
# webGUI reads .page headers line by line and a trailing CR hides the tab.
# This pins the checkout to LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.page text eol=lf
*.php text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.plg text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.txz binary
